data: {"id": "4a265bf8873f4d0d-thinking-parallel_evidence-563", "run_id": "4a265bf8873f4d0d", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已采集的事实：\n\n**支持 CrashLoopBackOff 的证据：**\n- kubectl_get_by_name 显示 READY=0/1, STATUS=CrashLoopBackOff, RESTARTS=28 (17s ago)\n- kubectl_get_yaml 确认 containerStatus.app: ready=False, restarts=28, reason=CrashLoopBackOff, exitCode=2\n- kubectl_describe 显示 Warning BackOff (x544 over 121m), Reason=CrashLoopBackOff\n- kubectl_events 一致：Back-off restarting failed container app\n\n**容器崩溃根因证据：**\n- kubectl_previous_logs_all_containers 返回关键日志：`\"event\":\"http_request\",\"level\":\"error\",\"message\":\"runtime process exi", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1788791551584, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

